<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Alternatifbank signs $15 mln synd loan.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Alternatifbank signs $15 mln synd loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Alternatifbank signed an accord for a $15 million syndicated loan on Friday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the accord for the one-year pre-export financing facility, led by Citibank and Bayerische Vereinsbank, was signed in Istanbul. Alahli Bank of Kuwait, Chase Manhattan Bank, Berliner Bank, Bank Handlowy, Bayerische-Bulgarische Handelsbank are other syndication members.</p>
<p>It did not give any further detials.</p>
